*** Keywords ***
General_SiSo_Auto_DL_Test_Model_Activation_Admin
    [Documentation]
    ...  Activates NR Downlink Test Model using admin API. Version for TDD and FDD radios.
    ...  Steps:
    ...  - start NR DL Test Model
    ...  - check If Test Model Is Active via admin API
    ...  - stop NR DL Test Model
    ...
    ...  :param int cell_id: (Mandatory) : Global cell id of tested NR cell.
    ...  :param str test_model: (Mandatory) NR DL test models supported for cell configuration e.g.:
    ...                                     "NR-FR1-TM1.1", "NR-FR1-TM1.2",
    ...                                     "NR-FR1-TM2", "NR-FR1-TM2a",
    ...                                     "NR-FR1-TM3.1", "NR-FR1-TM3.1a", "NR-FR1-TM3.2", "NR-FR1-TM3.3",
    ...                         It's possible to run many test models at once on tested cell by giving argument test_model as list of strings.
    ...                         In Robot Framework structure it's required to create list before starting Test Case, then pass the list
    ...                         as test_model parameter, e.g. :
    ...                         @{test_models}=         Create List                    NR-FR1-TM1.1  NR-FR1-TM1.2  NR-FR1-TM3.1
    ...                         General_SiSo_Auto_DL_Test_Model_Activation_Admin       test_model=${test_models}
    ...                         WARNING: Models "TM1.1_ETSI" and "IdleActive" are only available after entering R&D mode beforehand.
    ...  :param str power_backoff: (Optional) : powerBackoff parameter, range <0 to 490>, default 0.
    ...  :param str ru_mode (Optional): RU mode [NR_Only | Customize_1 | MSR], default NR_Only.
    ...  :param str mimo_rank: (Optional) : MIMO rank parameter, range <1 to 4>, default 1.
    ...  :param str codebook_2_antports: (Optional) : code book 2 ant ports parameter, range <0 to 3>, default 0.
    ...  :param bool vswr_monitoring: (Optional) : Enable VSWR monitoring parameter, default False.
    ...  :param int beam_pattern_id: (Optional) : Beam pattern ID parameter, range <0 to 1200>, default 1.
    ...  :param str polarization: (Optional) : One of following: "P_plus45_or_0", "P_minus45_or_90", "P_both", default "P_plus45_or_0".
    ...  :param int pmax: (Optional) : pMax parameter, range <30 to 49>, default 30.
    ...  :param int test_duration: (Optional) : duration of the test in seconds, default 30.
    ...  :param str admin_test_name: (Optional) : name of NR Downlink Test Model visible when checked via admin API, default "NR_DOWNLINK".
    [Arguments]  ${cell_id}
    ...          ${test_model}
    ...          ${power_backoff}=0
    ...          ${ru_mode}=NR_Only
    ...          ${mimo_rank}=1
    ...          ${codebook_2_antports}=0
    ...          ${vswr_monitoring}=False
    ...          ${beam_pattern_id}=1
    ...          ${polarization}=P_plus45_or_0
    ...          ${pmax}=30
    ...          ${test_duration}=30
    ...          ${admin_test_name}=NR_DOWNLINK
    [Timeout]    24 hours

    ${connection}                                           connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ${cell_dist_names}  ${physical_cell_id}                 Get Cell Info for Performance Test
    ...                                                     config_nr_cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    &{nrarfcn}=                                             tm_setup_adm.get_nrafcn_variables_for_nr_cell_id
    ...                                                     cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     sep_channels_for_tdd=${True}

    @{test_models_list}                                     tm_startup.create_test_models_list
    ...                                                     test_model=${test_model}
    
    Robot Log Operation                                     Performing the following NR Downlink test types: ${test_models_list}
    FOR    ${test}    IN                                    @{test_models_list}
        Start NR Downlink Test Model                        connection=${connection}
        ...                                                 cell_distname=${cell_dist_names["run_time"]}
        ...                                                 test_model=${test}
        ...                                                 phys_cell_id=${physical_cell_id}
        ...                                                 nrarfcn_dl=${nrarfcn['nrarfcn_downlink']}
        ...                                                 power_backoff=${power_backoff}
        ...                                                 ru_mode=${ru_mode}
        ...                                                 mimo_rank=${mimo_rank}
        ...                                                 codebook_2_antports=${codebook_2_antports}
        ...                                                 vswr_monitoring=${vswr_monitoring}
        ...                                                 nrarfcn_ul=${nrarfcn['nrarfcn_uplink']}
        ...                                                 beam_pattern_id=${beam_pattern_id}
        ...                                                 polarization=${polarization}
        ...                                                 pmax=${pmax}

        Check If Test Model Is Active                       admin_test_name=${admin_test_name}
        ...                                                 cell_id=${cell_id}
        ...                                                 connection=${connection}
        sleep                                               ${test_duration}s
        
        Stop NR Downlink Test Model                         cell_distname=${cell_dist_names["run_time"]}
        ...                                                 connection=${connection}
        ...                                                 test_model=${test}
        ...                                                 admin_test_name=${admin_test_name}

        Robot Log Step                                      Successfully executed ${test} Test Model!\n
    END
    Robot Log Step                                          All NR Downlink Test Models have finished successfully.
    
    [Teardown]                                              NR Downlink Test Model Teardown
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     cell_r_distnames=${cell_dist_names["run_time"]}
